<title>USA: Motel 6 to buy Allstar Inns.</title>
<headline>Motel 6 to buy Allstar Inns.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA BARBARA, Calif. 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allstar Inns Inc said Motel 6 has exercised an option to buy its 71 hotels comprising 7,606 rooms.</p>
<p>The purchase price was $40 million in cash plus the assumption of $206 million in debt.</p>
</text>
